---
description: Apply EngineeringSpec contracts during consequential engineering changes
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow @AGENTS.md.

Use the shared lifecycle: explore, propose, approve, implement, verify, close. Before modifying code, run `engineeringspec prepare <contract-id> --spec-dir docs/engineering-specs --base origin/main --strict` and follow its base-pinned writable surfaces, constraints, verifier identities, source intent, and unresolved questions. Reading repository code for correctness remains allowed; writing outside declared surfaces does not. Before ending a turn, run `engineeringspec check --spec-dir docs/engineering-specs --base origin/main --strict`; it checks the complete working state. Fix or escalate violations. Widen approved targets in a contract-only change before implementing against them. Specification-declared runners are inert.
